  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c8a2d89f-4020-5e88-b1f3-a2e27adab80b" activityNameId="3923f18a-5f2f-5a8e-b0f5-fbc3008d3364" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Green manure organic, until February</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Green manure organic, until February
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg green manure organic, until February.;
Synonyms: catch crop; 
UUID: 6f61e1cf-94e9-314b-ae36-6d50802681c7
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing and mulching. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the farm are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: Refers to an average production in the Swiss lowlands.
Technology: Organic production
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f61e1cf-94e9-314b-ae36-6d50802681c7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
